 **Data Structures**
 The core data structure is a multivariate Gaussian approximation of a conical frustum [S1]. It is characterized by:
-*   Origin $\mathbf{o}$ and direction $\mathbf{d}$ of the cone axis.
-*   Mean distance along the ray $\mu_t$.
-*   Variance along the ray $\sigma_t^2$.
-*   Variance perpendicular to the ray $\sigma_r^2$.
